{"id":"msg_m_subquest_1312_s","cat":"messenger","group":{"id":"room_edennotice","label":"Eden Notice · Quest"},"label":"3. We've got an emergency.","stage":null,"prev":"msg_m_subquest_1311_e","next":"msg_m_subquest_1312_e","speakers":{"cecil":"Cecil","noah":"Noah","harran":"Harran","dorothy":"Dorothy","johan":"Johan","isabel":"Isabel"},"icons":{"cecil":"si_c929_00_s","noah":"si_c232_00_s","harran":"si_c230_00_s","dorothy":"si_c233_00_s","johan":"si_c925_00_s","isabel":"si_c231_00_s"},"lines":[{"id":"m_subquest_1312_s_1","type":"Speech","speaker":"cecil","key":"Locale_SubScenario:m_subquest_1312_s_1","text":"We've got an emergency.","jump":null},{"id":"m_subquest_1312_s_2","type":"Speech","speaker":"cecil","key":"Locale_SubScenario:m_subquest_1312_s_2","text":"We're detecting 9 raptures at location EJD 299.34","jump":null},{"id":"m_subquest_1312_s_3","type":"Speech","speaker":"cecil","key":"Locale_SubScenario:m_subquest_1312_s_3","text":"At their current speed, they'll reach the base in 15 minutes and 33 seconds.","jump":null},{"id":"m_subquest_1312_s_4","type":"Speech","speaker":"noah","key":"Locale_SubScenario:m_subquest_1312_s_4","text":"Well well,","jump":null},{"id":"m_subquest_1312_s_5","type":"Speech","speaker":"noah","key":"Locale_SubScenario:m_subquest_1312_s_5","text":"it's been a hot minute since they came this close.","jump":null},{"id":"m_subquest_1312_s_6","type":"Self","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_SubScenario:m_subquest_1312_s_6","text":"Isn't the base concealed using optical camouflage?","jump":null},{"id":"m_subquest_1312_s_7","type":"Speech","speaker":"cecil","key":"Locale_SubScenario:m_subquest_1312_s_7","text":"That's right,","jump":null},{"id":"m_subquest_1312_s_8","type":"Speech","speaker":"cecil","key":"Locale_SubScenario:m_subquest_1312_s_8","text":"but optical camouflage is not a physical barrier.","jump":null},{"id":"m_subquest_1312_s_9","type":"Speech","speaker":"cecil","key":"Locale_SubScenario:m_subquest_1312_s_9","text":"It's merely a curtain that keeps the base invisible to the naked eye.","jump":null},{"id":"m_subquest_1312_s_10","type":"Speech","speaker":"cecil","key":"Locale_SubScenario:m_subquest_1312_s_10","text":"Although it doesn't happen often,","jump":null},{"id":"m_subquest_1312_s_11","type":"Speech","speaker":"cecil","key":"Locale_SubScenario:m_subquest_1312_s_11","text":"there have been occasions where Raptures accidently walk through the curtain.","jump":null},{"id":"m_subquest_1312_s_12","type":"Speech","speaker":"cecil","key":"Locale_SubScenario:m_subquest_1312_s_12","text":"It's a bit of a headache, but whenever that happens, someone needs to go and take care of them.","jump":null},{"id":"m_subquest_1312_s_13","type":"Speech","speaker":"harran","key":"Locale_SubScenario:m_subquest_1312_s_13","text":"So who's up this time?","jump":null},{"id":"m_subquest_1312_s_14","type":"Speech","speaker":"harran","key":"Locale_SubScenario:m_subquest_1312_s_14","text":"I'm busy developing a new essence.","jump":null},{"id":"m_subquest_1312_s_15","type":"Speech","speaker":"dorothy","key":"Locale_SubScenario:m_subquest_1312_s_15","text":"Sorry, I've got my hands full with some personal errands.","jump":null},{"id":"m_subquest_1312_s_16","type":"Speech","speaker":"johan","key":"Locale_SubScenario:m_subquest_1312_s_16","text":"Noah and I are in the middle of an operation.","jump":null},{"id":"m_subquest_1312_s_17","type":"Speech","speaker":"johan","key":"Locale_SubScenario:m_subquest_1312_s_17","text":"{AccountData.NickName},","jump":null},{"id":"m_subquest_1312_s_18","type":"Speech","speaker":"johan","key":"Locale_SubScenario:m_subquest_1312_s_18","text":"you seem to be free, yes?","jump":null},{"id":"m_subquest_1312_s_19","type":"Choice","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_SubScenario:m_subquest_1312_s_19","text":"I was about to volunteer.","jump":"m_subquest_1312_s_21"},{"id":"m_subquest_1312_s_20","type":"Choice","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_SubScenario:m_subquest_1312_s_20","text":"What about Isabel?","